ry well-balanced thing.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"15:20","t":"And We have made for you therein means of living and [for] those for whom you are not providers.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"15:21","t":"And there is not a thing but that with Us are its depositories, and We do not send it down except according to a known [i.e., specified] measure.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"15:22","t":"And We have sent the fertilizing winds and sent down water from the sky and given you drink from it. And you are not its retainers.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"15:23","t":"And indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and We are the Inheritor.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"15:24","t":"And We have already known the preceding [generations] among you, and We have already known the later [ones to come].","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"15:25","t":"And indeed, your Lord will gather them; indeed, He is Wise and Knowing.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"15:26","t":"And We did certainly create man out of clay from an altered black mud.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"15:27","t":"And the jinn We created before from scorching fire.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"15:28","t":"And [mention, O Muḥammad], when your Lord said to the angels, \"I will create a human being out of clay from an altered black mud.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"15:29","t":"And when I have proportioned him and breathed into him of My [created] soul, then fall down to him in prostration.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"15:30","t":"So the angels prostrated - all of them entirely,","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"15:31","t":"Except Iblees; he refused to be with those who prostrated.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":31,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[15],"sajdah":false}